
Welcome to AstroOS, a rolling research workstation built on Arch Linux.

  astroos-doctor           health check; paste its output in bug reports
  astroos-hacking-heavy    install the heavy pentest set (burpsuite, metasploit, zaproxy, seclists)
  astroos-cuda-setup       CUDA stack on NVIDIA hardware

Source, issues and release notes: https://github.com/bakathefish/ASTRO-OS

